{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45597","headline":"田家作 · 贯休","name":"田家作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家老翁无可作，昼甑蒸梨香漠漠。\n只向堦前曝背眠，赤桑大叶时时落。\n古壍侵门桃竹密，仓囤峨峨欲遮日。\n自云孙子解耕耘，四五年来腹多实。\n我闻此语心自悲，世上悠悠岂得知，稼而不穑徒尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}